  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">증발 실험을 한다면, 이게 제격입니다!<br>물론 학생들이 알코올 냄새 난다고<br>으악~ 하는 경우가 있지만,<br>금방 적응하고 잘 합니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cff222ddc5a006f6ee1930442831d2f7b25f6135\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cff222ddc5a006f6ee1930442831d2f7b25f6135\" data-origin-width=\"2850\" data-origin-height=\"2960\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/369d37dc550f6c5d382fbfb252a14feece324169\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/369d37dc550f6c5d382fbfb252a14feece324169\" data-origin-width=\"1029\" data-origin-height=\"1478\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5745d7a6e33f33a4abc5155aed731be355e7e4e9\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5745d7a6e33f33a4abc5155aed731be355e7e4e9\" data-origin-width=\"1014\" data-origin-height=\"1478\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">저거 그림 그릴때, 뭔가 너무 물같아서<br>고민 좀 했네요</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ce6a5f90171eb26f6f9505c8fff49022d2dd2bd2\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ce6a5f90171eb26f6f9505c8fff49022d2dd2bd2\" data-origin-width=\"1021\" data-origin-height=\"1465\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">꼭 직접 해보세요! 결과 잘나옵니다!<br><br>[네이버 블로그] 블로그를 소개합니다.<br>쿼카쌤의 수업꾸러미 | 최효석<br><a href=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111</a></p><div class=\"f